> On Friday, August 29, 2014 20:46:56 Gleki Arxokuna wrote:
> > Which words do you consider silly?
> > a fu'ivla for "Bella Coola" language can be named silly but this language
> > was discussed by Lojbanists in past.
>
> I consider the entire banXXX set, where XXX is a language code that is
> somehow
> mangled into something pronounceable in Lojban, silly. Those words begin
> with
> a rafsi, but do not follow the form of type-3 fu'ivla. If I were discussing
> Bella Coola, I'd call it "nu'alka" or "belkula", not "banbulucu".
>
> Pierre
